/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * A real Frontier journal `Loadout` event for an unreleased Anaconda Mk II, with an A-rated
 * power plant, thrusters, frame shift drive and power distributor, D-rated life support and
 * sensors, the stock fuel tank, no weapons and no shield generator. The ship was unlocked for ARX, so no credits were
 * paid for it: the event carries no `HullValue` and no module `Value`, and its `ModulesValue` and
 * `Rebuy` do not record a credit purchase.
 *
 * Contributed 2026-10-22 UTC by the repository owner from their own fleet, with no upstream
 * project. The pasted source line has SHA-256
 * `fb06ace53c02a42b286cf8afc5268698f4eba5a0a0bf0577fc5bd683a6cac8a4`; the stored, re-indented
 * fixture has SHA-256 `17cf99be64885369b56c69fec52eebaf1d4bd579ae8885364cff8a928152edc8`.
 *
 * `ShipName`, `ShipIdent`, `ShipID` and `timestamp` are kept — they describe a ship, and nothing
 * in the event names a person. `ShipName` is empty in the event as received.
 *
 * The capture is Elite Dangerous game output and remains the property of Frontier Developments
 * plc, redistributed under Frontier's media-usage terms; see ATTRIBUTIONS.md.
 *
 * A stored checksum here is of the payload alone, taken with this header comment removed; a source
 * checksum is of the upstream file as it was received.
 */
